# Keep the Docker build context small (.venv/ and assets/ alone are GiBs).
# The Dockerfiles (deploy/Dockerfile.{base,nvidia,amd}) only COPY the
# requirement/constraint files, HURI_CORE_REF, packages/ and
# deploy/install_huri.sh — huri-core is installed from its own repository at
# that ref, not from the build context. Nothing below is needed.
.venv/
.git/
node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.log
**/build/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
assets/
.huri-local/
